#: scenario3:scenario3_B22C54AE_13D7_4EF6_98DD_84AB3228666B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73edcce0893c7df0c7ba026152edabcc9b2f3f490aaacd715c1207e1103bd92f
#. default-sha256: 833e8a556295188f09fe1e9655cb433cf29610e6b37cc7b64137d01766a8880e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B22C54AE_13D7_4EF6_98DD_84AB3228666B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Master. ⟪k:4⟫Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……旦那さま、⟪k:4⟫旦那さま。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2FCCFDD8_433A_4294_9CB6_5C7C35CDD92C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3e3efecb0691ea48eacfaa11da42270e2a1188848e5e5a50ecf40f6a5fc8ca9
#. default-sha256: 99af5ebad44659da2ab4424e9cfa8d4876c923a1dc8272f6af216101cd5d7d49
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2FCCFDD8_433A_4294_9CB6_5C7C35CDD92C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you shocked?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or do you instead lament this development?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫驚いていらっしゃるでしょうか？　⟪k:1⟫それとも、⟪k:2⟫嘆いていらっしゃる？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1EFB07A8_8D5D_4CCA_9EFD_23CE0ACEAA07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12e61aaa05b18b480f968686d16b7ef48dd3e4c00b7e6ef8c4d84c176bc7e184
#. default-sha256: 13b36c13f1ad375a6112e9ea35e501a56ec10032ce48e547e2d4e28ccd9aa2a9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1EFB07A8_8D5D_4CCA_9EFD_23CE0ACEAA07"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was... ⟪k:1⟫I was deeply sorrowful.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Though to a lesser degree about Maria’s true "
"intentions and more my shameful inability to recognize her machinations."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくしは、⟪k:1⟫そうですね……。⟪k:2⟫とても悲しみましたわ。⟪k:3⟫マリーアの本心にというより、"
"⟪k:4⟫気づけなかった自分自身が不甲斐なくて、⟪k:5⟫でしょうか。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_69DB4C0C_31D8_4AFE_B6DE_D91912124EB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d716651f62a8331d07c136ac3a69eef55ef792174990bb8b887673d0007dd1bd
#. default-sha256: a8da0a586fb203ffa910e1bd1b48e43416970d2344c6f1febb95741c51fc510f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_69DB4C0C_31D8_4AFE_B6DE_D91912124EB6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At the time, I too believed that Maria was the White-Haired Girl’s one and only ally."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫当時のわたくしは、⟪k:1⟫マリーアこそが、⟪k:2⟫白い髪の娘に対する唯一の味方であると信じておりま"
"したから。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A420E2B1_D973_4284_8769_540A95782AF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 611e7ef464f4e94a2b3a050ac91923cc0405a610a129669bd19f73ea6a54142a
#. default-sha256: 68ef8f8f043b9fad0d3359bd9989efc16fc3e36f3f44ecee00569e2e470cb71e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A420E2B1_D973_4284_8769_540A95782AF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not until everything had drawn to a close that I discovered the truth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくしがすべてを知るのは、⟪k:1⟫すべて、⟪k:2⟫終わった後なのでございます。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0FBCF4C5_58AC_40A3_9903_30F2EEDD78E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ea931f00737894df1761cc0435a4f997bfcd0da818e3c4d210107ccf9cf1836
#. default-sha256: db2de4c83bdc5b402fc9c7e86a44d760f2a1b1c581a6b0e572980b9443552a76
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0FBCF4C5_58AC_40A3_9903_30F2EEDD78E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Then I now know how the tale ends, you say? ⟪k:1⟫Yes, that is correct."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……それなら、⟪k:1⟫今この時は、⟪k:2⟫結末まで知っているのではないかって？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫そうですわ"
"ね、⟪k:5⟫その通りですわ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BEED55E5_FC2D_4478_B59E_1B24A3621BE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62cbead448d510f9c3713d2505f8fc5291010701ad86a0d2d16e718f6e229a44
#. default-sha256: c7fc4aac30e1b651cdc36d59d698b8d5bc5a162a70c8f4ee2e1f74240e89f05c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BEED55E5_FC2D_4478_B59E_1B24A3621BE8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Well aware that it was not the case, I told you the story in a way that suggested she ⟪k:1⟫"
"was⟪k:2⟫ on the White-Haired Girl’s side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくしはすべてを知りながら、⟪k:1⟫あたかも彼女が本当の味方であるように伝えておりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_037D8825_28AD_45EC_B463_30A9229BB447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 427fe823920626fcc999c74d0a5651e12bc1192589bfe2344ff9c9e8241988d4
#. default-sha256: 9c7a2bfb8c1a2f47dfb4edb61c5e7178ba7ee86383ce55201efecea9828eb137
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_037D8825_28AD_45EC_B463_30A9229BB447"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh my... ⟪k:1⟫I wonder if that constitutes lying to you, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あら……、⟪k:1⟫これって、⟪k:2⟫旦那さまに対する嘘になってしまうのでしょうか。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_536BA22B_D9AB_4269_98F1_CF7925EE61BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b298390ababb3dae8b8069729754e7ed45bb0b6e2747b691b150defe5db25484
#. default-sha256: 29672e9278480a8a8c9b101d3971642a2c1e6a7a9f230168d8f66b2b4fe6af48
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_536BA22B_D9AB_4269_98F1_CF7925EE61BA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I merely wanted to present the events to you in order, starting from the beginning, when "
"Maria’s ill intentions were still veiled in shadow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれどわたくしは、⟪k:1⟫順を追って、⟪k:2⟫すべてをお伝えしたかったのです。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫マリーアの"
"悪意を何も知らなかった頃から、⟪k:5⟫ひとつひとつ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B07B1C5C_AD18_48B5_9A1C_9188D3B65528
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b616183320d8c3733f5e4ab84523331432627c416b86c4d3d64cc8c478c88a8
#. default-sha256: d80f2fd327e588b6d4b5eff4e56899a76ce61e80a7e9091c4fb924553b41c5cd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B07B1C5C_AD18_48B5_9A1C_9188D3B65528"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted you to know the same feeling of consternation I had experienced."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたくしの驚きを……悲しみを。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫あなた様にも、⟪k:3⟫分かっていただきたかったのです……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E9E59592_BFFD_4854_A962_ECEE24240B56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfdbab2bacb06a4597157e279875c0daaeb28c725493c9abb17d952d7b4395bd
#. default-sha256: 5b32ea35d82da74625a64b4993e06846628b04cbf96ef65a7b194dae3a13ebd9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E9E59592_BFFD_4854_A962_ECEE24240B56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫The White-Haired Girl continued to write letter "
"after letter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫白い髪の娘は、⟪k:10⟫それから何通も何通も手紙を書"
"きました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F1FC3C19_29B2_4F4C_836F_C0D34DD55451
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c1e4d7a099e088e74e92a8df860fd9ff4fce56c965b529f78f5495f6260863d
#. default-sha256: bde6a84a3af95cbdadcaba26dd7fc7aca4da308639d5f502d89e63e722be2b03
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F1FC3C19_29B2_4F4C_836F_C0D34DD55451"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They were all addressed to her dear husband, detailing her ever-persistent love for him..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫宛先には、⟪k:1⟫愛する夫の名を書いて。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫自分がまだ、⟪k:4⟫昔のように想い続けているこ"
"と。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8FD88E68_AF08_459F_BEA4_43220459FE5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c157ea12d49c4e625ceb8ca5cc99253383a5a7aea75ce838ae8fb7e09097ee57
#. default-sha256: ad02ec1476e5e78a7e2ef6da6eaaba789b3e7b8584d31c56bc08176146d155b6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8FD88E68_AF08_459F_BEA4_43220459FE5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and her desire for their relationship to return to what it had once been."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫昔のような関係に戻りたいことを、⟪k:1⟫書き連ねました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7332670A_DF5B_43B9_8DC2_C59C37EC2896
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f9ed6df16a332844afe577cab1738077b41551c74cf4d9d15fb8c61bfe04266
#. default-sha256: 7bc0601d0f61884ae91b25d4efc1f3b0a5eed4ae9fe8f042d608325e6a1bb1af
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7332670A_DF5B_43B9_8DC2_C59C37EC2896"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My beloved,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I am sure your hands are quite full right now.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫愛するあなた。⟪k:1⟫あなたはきっと、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫今は目の前のことで一杯なのでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7377A6CF_B0F7_4CE8_9A1E_B62F992FB17E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a51be945b0bfe3a35a0a8103f1aebad4ff5ca1a5dc467c11384e85e99931e1c5
#. default-sha256: f217ab4e7a4297948dfe06484b1f2a816a13014b952b47053a37ad9f66ef5841
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7377A6CF_B0F7_4CE8_9A1E_B62F992FB17E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But that is fine; it does not change my love for you.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私はそれでも構いません。⟪k:1⟫それでもあなたを愛しています。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6C01F95_238D_42FB_8CEB_21E1ACDEB556
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 11b5ff4fceee751381eb14dc9babaeaba5817dff25ddbe3540bfa2b52d1b41c0
#. default-sha256: 9c5d3adab7ce77d52240b03b7abecc4a4b8417370f0bb2621ea8f315578b02b8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6C01F95_238D_42FB_8CEB_21E1ACDEB556"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you remember the day we went out together?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That was, perhaps, the most "
"wonderful day of my life.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I had a truly incredible time.⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫一緒に出掛けた時のことを、⟪k:1⟫覚えていますか？　⟪k:2⟫私、⟪k:3⟫あの時本当に、⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫楽し"
"かった。⟪k:6⟫人生で一番素敵な日だったと思います。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F3789E13_79DE_4518_A353_0ECBAA53CEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f3c5b471324724d33bb201951ea9484154db5bff231c9b849ec68ada99020f3
#. default-sha256: ebf3600165990c42e8fbc8ee7741aaa1cc3817843239186811dc96e52489b3af
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F3789E13_79DE_4518_A353_0ECBAA53CEF0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I still treasure the gift you gave to me,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫for it is the one and only present I "
"have received from you...⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あなたにもらった宝物も、⟪k:1⟫大事に取っているんです。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫あれは、⟪k:4⟫あなたから貰った"
"唯一のものですから……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_078A285C_DB66_4D08_A856_7F85CABAF5BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e1785cb4037016e98026f68560dfb117972131c9b1084f0a9bce4e8d2618091
#. default-sha256: 5d2bf8ecea0480a2a4fc0b208dc917fcb370e8bbda91001716519897b0bbf7bc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_078A285C_DB66_4D08_A856_7F85CABAF5BF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That reminds me, Maria tried to teach me how to dance.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I doubt I will ever "
"progress beyond being laughably bad, though...⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そういえば――、⟪k:1⟫マリーアに踊りを教えてもらったんです。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫私の踊りなんて、⟪k:4⟫滑稽"
"なものにしかならないと思いますけど……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E062BEDC_9AE6_477E_9EAB_2F776BA9919A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6bf67a4e1f902878519a722865905df5410df05a00350cc305d000195b73e9c2
#. default-sha256: 509afd666d6f8f51f5789210af9a187926ae6641f007e6b1277d0a8a7a7f324d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E062BEDC_9AE6_477E_9EAB_2F776BA9919A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It would be nice if, someday, you and I could dance together.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫いつか、⟪k:1⟫あなたとも、⟪k:2⟫ダンスが出来たら素敵だと思います。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_26F96882_6E8B_4C97_88BF_D48D97982A92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbe23790eac4dc5e706b16abc6f1f54c4e57f2a5e4e39f9d10509ce40ea99125
#. default-sha256: 20d14db62dff326a167a2baede2722283506e9e8b4a580a47dd735fd16b8f65b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_26F96882_6E8B_4C97_88BF_D48D97982A92"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Perhaps, when you have a little respite from work, we could go out again, maybe take a "
"carriage somewhere a little farther away.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫お仕事が落ち着いたら、⟪k:1⟫また、⟪k:2⟫一緒に出掛けませんか。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫馬車を使って、⟪k:5⟫少し"
"遠出をして。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7D5F193_D18B_482C_9412_88BCDF5A0C93
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7f45ca8b4550dd547a434e2db7cce8867360ec43af05a8857049a56ef8d29e76
#. default-sha256: 2c1bdd38cb70efe7a8947ad53e0928c1caa159210b1f93b4dac50cab89f0fe88
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7D5F193_D18B_482C_9412_88BCDF5A0C93"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And we could dine at a restaurant more to your liking.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫今度は、⟪k:1⟫美味しいレストランに行きましょうね。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_470CC718_B9D6_41CC_B704_B9206DFD8ED6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7acf5da8ec7cb38146a56cdb9943d60b6f82a51e66d332816a5ba41bae8e32e5
#. default-sha256: b27da886de3edd51377da165b91c810b33baf7e689434489a52be7e4926fa618
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_470CC718_B9D6_41CC_B704_B9206DFD8ED6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Although, I think the cuisine at the other restaurant was exquisite, personally.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫私にとっては……、⟪k:2⟫あなたと一緒に行ったレストランの味も、⟪k:3⟫素晴らしかったと思"
"うんです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C35D0B18_64E9_408C_8AD3_1673B334D207
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6da168e810c9db9ed941705594a8d99a60da49722118d3e3893e61cb92e37627
#. default-sha256: 1eb3433c9e10b57eb077e2d839d9f877d9dc0b20176eb4fd89cd85a512e5c0cc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C35D0B18_64E9_408C_8AD3_1673B334D207"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do I, perhaps, have an unrefined palate?⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私、⟪k:1⟫味覚音痴なのかしら？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F55CE928_ED20_4637_8482_B36D44AB0A51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76dbcf41b1a0d876cfdcf7bc2d36991ba820536bec461f69e47e0e23399ea4cc
#. default-sha256: 6945bbf59318316f222a791be1eb308630d8997d0e6236c8199ca83c597d3a38
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F55CE928_ED20_4637_8482_B36D44AB0A51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria altered the letters before delivering them, however.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She changed the "
"addressee from Jacopo to another man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫その手紙は、⟪k:2⟫マリーアによって改ざんされていきます。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫宛先は本来向け"
"られたヤコポではなく、⟪k:5⟫別人へ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6A9592E1_29C1_4FB4_885C_5B810929B83F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d944ac935158f2774048300aeca68c763de5fea0742fec9e41477314d0f6265f
#. default-sha256: 1cfa865ace1202ca8864b7e8787eb5a6892840336fed174269b92ded675a5b5e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6A9592E1_29C1_4FB4_885C_5B810929B83F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She would cut away the top of the page with Jacopo’s name on it, and in the space below "
"write a different name."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫マリーアは、⟪k:1⟫手紙の上部に書かれたヤコポの名を切り離し――、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫その下に別人の名前を書"
"いていたのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFBC8CD9_BD05_4D83_868A_BE1F230C0838
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9709ba3919f7c6e3b13b9a35bbac44034aeb0bd2bc3dd20efa34822ade9e69e1
#. default-sha256: 2697af3bc11df6a9d5e0202279f764f196ab82f7837306e2cafd2e803066651e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFBC8CD9_BD05_4D83_868A_BE1F230C0838"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She could not have mimicked the White-Haired Girl’s handwriting for the full length of a "
"letter, but Maria could make a single name look adequately similar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫全文の筆跡を真似るのは不可能でしたけれど、⟪k:1⟫宛名だけであれば何とかなりましたわ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_101EB0A4_AF89_43CD_B7F7_037D32EFC20E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 797d6834a967306aa1667687bf10271866dbc91b6da37e4515c2da397af6a078
#. default-sha256: 5056202a004db883df480f45e565348f0ae6e14d18dc376f6f22d8927cf05e11
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_101EB0A4_AF89_43CD_B7F7_037D32EFC20E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it would, after all, be quite difficult to notice minor discrepancies in such a small "
"quantity of text."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それに、⟪k:1⟫人名ひとつ程度なら、⟪k:2⟫多少筆が歪んでも気づかれませんでしたから……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BD12B27F_7A2B_4DBC_A3C2_7F4056F82166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0bf386d7ad2f4edc0762d5d0c02c555399cc5a35f3279051b3814d9987aab372
#. default-sha256: 2d225b33063b140f8b3c9c93ce309e846df066ebdea283a3331532d264367d7b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BD12B27F_7A2B_4DBC_A3C2_7F4056F82166"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Again... ⟪k:10⟫Another letter?!⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Why "
"does she keep writing these?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫また……、⟪k:10⟫また手紙か……！　⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫なぜこ"
"んなものを書き続ける……ッ！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B5983E94_BBC9_45BF_B0FB_1B0C2E30EB64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69242b7fbb8601f33134b4164785c3661109ec46d14e4eecd043cb12ff83cf4d
#. default-sha256: 8410ba2f1c9355906e37d298322aafdb844409a4785412057adc3b29dbc687ef
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B5983E94_BBC9_45BF_B0FB_1B0C2E30EB64"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To Jacopo’s eyes, the modified letters looked like professions of love for another man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫宛名を変えられてしまった手紙は、⟪k:1⟫ヤコポの目には「他人へのラブレター」にしか映りませんでし"
"た。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_62944463_45B4_447D_9941_303F4D8DC728
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 204f525226d2684158c20603481ba600a87e8a9e42cae384d7d1a81c58292e78
#. default-sha256: 5cddaac73fec4d7c7f84f690bb8a4eb0e7ba76a7e06b8b0654e16dceac0343b5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_62944463_45B4_447D_9941_303F4D8DC728"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more she inscribed of her feelings for Jacopo, the greater the turmoil grew within his "
"heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫白い髪の娘が、⟪k:1⟫紙の上で愛を紡げば紡ぐほど――彼の心は、⟪k:2⟫乱されていくのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAE71367_CD0B_413F_9F18_85D94107EED6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a1ab5bb0c903992ea852b6a1d4c5e1bfcaed67681035de3786212a0765c0753
#. default-sha256: 18e492bf541333aad059d058c469023c45cf9fa669a0d6166d0782799412895c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAE71367_CD0B_413F_9F18_85D94107EED6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Even though her love was directed toward him..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫本当は、⟪k:1⟫そのすべての愛が、⟪k:2⟫彼自身に注がれているというのに……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74677037_C960_434B_8799_3174A9E124B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37f505a206ba1d5853c6071d61a38f484b4fe77da7219211b08ac1016c41c449
#. default-sha256: d5af664b0fcfcbccaff5b87e7eeabfbebf33573ac3fa3b7a85c515e893cb15d0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74677037_C960_434B_8799_3174A9E124B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I can’t— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can’t believe what I’m reading!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫こんな――、⟪k:1⟫こんな、⟪k:2⟫こんな手紙ッ………！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B4D774AE_816B_411C_8AE3_D158DE11CA5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 875ef2c743e49032d48c5be878eb9936a3fb64d670c7c2340a5ad9f637766cd8
#. default-sha256: 6e34b48c2c5ed4a9ba76c44a3cf14772ec39ff814169a68adadbd179ce5ff8ff
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B4D774AE_816B_411C_8AE3_D158DE11CA5A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“A restaurant more to your liking”?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I knew it... ⟪k:3⟫you ⟪k:4⟫have⟪k:5⟫ been going "
"out with other men, all the while pretending to be chaste in my presence!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫レストランだって――？　⟪k:1⟫やはり君は……私に対して貞淑な振りをして――他の男と出かけていたのだ"
"な……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3D9BCC94_FF43_4603_8A0E_F8BE68EDDE4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 836ec1965af6684e75def931d92f55bc7d75f493eacaac63985ad78f86c7a518
#. default-sha256: 34b7efef6c932e4f8ddea838475a81f9e4a597e37ee5504b236909cddc9605ec
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3D9BCC94_FF43_4603_8A0E_F8BE68EDDE4F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“I still treasure the gift you gave to me”?!⟪k:1⟫God’s sake!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何が宝物だ……ッ！　⟪k:1⟫くそ………！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABA07F0C_F921_46EC_9909_A42142880D1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c2e2ee5b24a173eee0125d7ef9b1efbb2d987c043049c31b6ccb7007b714f79
#. default-sha256: d7c7d1e9933bef6cc7b05dc8946ba24ac72080f2535af776e50c5eb94c859dbc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABA07F0C_F921_46EC_9909_A42142880D1D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You have to be fucking kidding!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ふざけるな………！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0232D285_6D4F_4DE2_961B_C1AE925083B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a587d7b270719f2381eaff7cf58f400e3a342c67e5744ac24a7f08b30c4e701f
#. default-sha256: a4f14a219e1090b8552c199c46f230232dbdf3484705d0b45848b9f7f09394f8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0232D285_6D4F_4DE2_961B_C1AE925083B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............Ngh."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………ッ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F166BBBD_C8BF_4057_99B4_957EBEB5174C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 683ad5667d5b96e81d6e8fe68f60f047fc5cff4b2bcb916fbf8568ed3b6fe295
#. default-sha256: 03ef5893da3095779d3e518a500e30b435b11f5fcc45426527d8371f1c27905d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F166BBBD_C8BF_4057_99B4_957EBEB5174C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(But I’ve ensured she can’t leave that room!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She’ll never see this man again...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫（だが――、⟪k:1⟫あの部屋からは出られないようにしているのだ！　⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　あいつが、⟪k:4⟫この"
"男と二度と会うことなんて……）"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AA5D9DB1_02B7_4FB2_95D3_F96965EED929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b389702f6352929db4568093ba5045aa0d1b32d274b4f1224061e6c666e1623
#. default-sha256: d4a91a54d5fb2b814512f7fb2d9a86357c4a7e78e363288d21473580b6cb379e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AA5D9DB1_02B7_4FB2_95D3_F96965EED929"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(In time, she’ll let go... ⟪k:1⟫and so will he...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（そのうちにあいつも諦めて……相手の男だって諦めて……）"

#: scenario3:scenario3_47ED758F_1A81_4DD6_9DFD_A30A6993178C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60885d7284131fbd366f907efc2527d5ec674cab591443d1060fdaecf05b760d
#. default-sha256: c3c07f8affb44760ee6ed45119ad91389d10d0a1654daa03a060758fabc55109
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_47ED758F_1A81_4DD6_9DFD_A30A6993178C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Ahh, listen to me.⟪k:1⟫Resigning myself to the hope that everything will fix itself...⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫How did I end up like this?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（ああ――、⟪k:1⟫私は、⟪k:2⟫こんなにも卑屈な考えをする男だったのか……）"

#: scenario3:scenario3_055210D6_0009_4EA9_A188_FCC724C81A56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a06cf386dbb356220410ce0f154671b19954a8a110e4f26ce0d0444fde280a50
#. default-sha256: 64b05c783969ee18b61b96bf4fa91ff862ca997e73478eb95a9b5eff88bb59a9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_055210D6_0009_4EA9_A188_FCC724C81A56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Such a pitiful man I’ve become...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（……こんな、⟪k:1⟫惨めな……）"

#: scenario3:scenario3_194B39BC_4CE1_43B0_A750_4A51ED4D218C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bd3aead1e8ed8164dd409bedc589648cf3001205c530dfaac78cc6a36e9cb67
#. default-sha256: 8ab60c47789f9eeeb754b26f4bbf7ca9d583b90ce65b8559199513948a175f70
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_194B39BC_4CE1_43B0_A750_4A51ED4D218C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On the surface, Maria acted quite heartbroken at the sight of their suffering."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫マリーアはそんな二人を見て、⟪k:1⟫表向きは大変悲しそうな素振りをしておりましたが――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C58F6CE_3BB5_46D1_9D98_F170AA9E7258
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03e506c9b5b1612d7eadfa34b2c61f75f4096e124411df47f04ab1e1839cd9b3
#. default-sha256: ec64578ff5c8514ae2ff9a7bda0d3b8bcc38a6335898826c86ef31a1fc70725a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C58F6CE_3BB5_46D1_9D98_F170AA9E7258"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But when she returned to her room, the walls echoed with her cackles. ⟪k:1⟫She derived a "
"great deal of entertainment from their squirming."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫部屋に戻れば、⟪k:1⟫思い出し笑いを響かせるのです。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼女にとっては、⟪k:4⟫二人の懊悩は"
"あまりに滑稽に見えたのでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CB7A3857_AA78_4D07_B7B6_E02AE4675CD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de0f86314e5771a48295abb8cda42b6f6c3f751e06a17981740af3ef9696b509
#. default-sha256: 9ced01aec8259e142df7ee2d4f5f354051f03b31af316555edc80a8d842a1880
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CB7A3857_AA78_4D07_B7B6_E02AE4675CD9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The more they writhed in anguish, the deeper her satisfaction grew."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼らが苦しめば苦しむほど。⟪k:1⟫悩めば悩むほど。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼女の愉悦は高まるばかりなのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_830ADD04_45C1_4706_87D5_99FFB88E5EF6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 727d7b9ff29fd2c3bdb719128665c7fbc54c8881a3ec16aa6adce8a3dd6389ee
#. default-sha256: e3e77f541754da0d95193c69da52ece1cb0c71e535489024c747ecc609eccbb2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_830ADD04_45C1_4706_87D5_99FFB88E5EF6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And both the White-Haired Girl and Jacopo continued to place their "
"confidence in Maria—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫the one responsible for everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫本当はすべてがマリーアの所為だと言うのに、⟪k:5⟫白い髪の娘も、⟪k:6⟫ヤコポ"
"も、⟪k:7⟫彼女を頼っておりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F465F1A3_FC1C_4DF5_9EA5_6575686FE7B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac582faf62541ce98df59a9bf383781996c6ce02a1e4e9f57fd57f2390ff5901
#. default-sha256: 90fdb39760f87f4ea6bba23443bea3f72ef20598c4133e754d7de91cdafef6e0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F465F1A3_FC1C_4DF5_9EA5_6575686FE7B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had never possessed a sense of distrust, and so she took everything "
"Maria said as truth, continuing, in her agony, to write Jacopo letters."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫元から人を疑うようなことのない白い髪の娘は、⟪k:1⟫マリーアの発言を鵜呑みにし――嘆きながらも、"
"⟪k:2⟫諦めることなく手紙を書くのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8FB8FE28_CCF5_4335_A6FA_77687A0B1BD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53c0a125bd09b10afb701e620ddc99535e61b62a11f36b4f55e65db988dc5e83
#. default-sha256: facca434ae693f794456af57eda20384058357c0b66dcc182819320e1d7c0fa1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8FB8FE28_CCF5_4335_A6FA_77687A0B1BD2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Letter after letter after letter."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何通も、⟪k:1⟫何通も、⟪k:2⟫何通も。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A921A368_BDAE_4AF0_AB5C_C3B1B5926459
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 921b7664c2ae200ca50cc8d99677803404afdbd10d35d8d1a8d44fb1e50a4b09
#. default-sha256: 14de0a7626ab22416717603645a06577418ce3972a63704416042fb819282cf7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A921A368_BDAE_4AF0_AB5C_C3B1B5926459"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My beloved,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are you still tied up with your work?⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫愛するあなた。⟪k:1⟫お仕事は、⟪k:2⟫まだ忙しいのでしょうか？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9521FB25_384A_47B1_8307_A477AB4052A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbfed9e4407e7216c72fa4d8a319a46a46bcbc895b9898e1aa4cfbc393cad4b6
#. default-sha256: 3ab8fda95bd61fffa4eeb41138cddd86cb5c04e99c2239e6c1f827ad69b628bc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9521FB25_384A_47B1_8307_A477AB4052A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It has been some time since we last saw one another,⟪k:2⟫so I know not what you have "
"been doing of late...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I only hope you remain in good health.⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫中々顔を合わせることもなくて、⟪k:1⟫あなたが今どうしているのかも分からない……。⟪k:2⟫せめて、"
"⟪k:3⟫健康で居て下されば良いのですけど。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E3071CFB_0BED_4668_BDC2_71A89B9879D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c72e00ca5a55c386b1addf92a1a452114078a3bfd6e5b7a405033b45263458c7
#. default-sha256: 1da475304642a608fe57f64697b171d8afec8ded221f42d9af364f1a55aa148d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E3071CFB_0BED_4668_BDC2_71A89B9879D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would, if possible, prefer to tell you everything in person, but I do not have the "
"courage, so these letters are my only option.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫本当は、⟪k:1⟫直接お会いして、⟪k:2⟫色々なことを伝えたいのです。⟪k:3⟫けれど私にはその勇気がなく"
"て、⟪k:4⟫こうして手紙に書くことしかできない。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FFEF22EE_0E20_4C8D_9732_3717FF8D9CA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f938026fbc6672a94432e1cedef404ce53d72061bef426e4a1450148e5a37c07
#. default-sha256: cae85ece024bee32ee28a18816617f3ee700681caa76c934e8bfd73d943f3437
