msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why could he not find it in himself to trust her?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perhaps doubting her was simply "
"easier."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……どうして、⟪k:1⟫信じることが出来ないのでしょう？　⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫信じることより、⟪k:4⟫疑う方が容"
"易いとでもいうのでしょうか。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_02F83CA3_4101_40CE_890F_DDC2792CE5D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8bcddb8528b6c215d611e82722fdcc07a30173f9fbe88fa9ae6335e2f8861be
