msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you were in his position... ⟪k:1⟫would you trust her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あなた様が同じ立場なら……信じてくれますか？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_35F58E7B_DAE2_401E_B9CA_4E67094F114F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a1054d16795d528298c7a19c4b3ecef184abb386ca708bbd07e3d6c219fccd9
