msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Would you maintain faith in her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the woman who had waited so long?⟪k:3⟫Would you "
"believe the feelings she professed for you were genuine?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ずっと待ってくれている人の気持ちを……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫疑わずに、⟪k:3⟫いてくれますか？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B258CCD9_53ED_4E32_B7B4_41798DF92CF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee6fffa112e5f8fdd7d0af17da51ec56e1c63e11637271d039dc0f8b41b428ac
