msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A418DE7_22D7_4FF4_B384_F3B33B5554EE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Speaking of which, before I left, an exhibition of some sort was held there.⟪k:2⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫故郷を思い出したついでに、⟪k:1⟫博覧会のことも頭を過りました。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫以前、⟪k:4⟫私の国でも"
"開かれたのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DE47C3A5_A349_4019_A735_6CE1C9FCA621
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ac5a4a1bae849090a2ff28466f7c8e6fdb44259639171d70773b16dba69373e
#. default-sha256: 9152dc85113f25550d13110e49c841c0667e42fa031a9b40cdf763fb1b7601bd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DE47C3A5_A349_4019_A735_6CE1C9FCA621"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was unable to attend... ⟪k:2⟫but perhaps you had the chance when it was near you?⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私は行けなかったのですが……、⟪k:1⟫あなたは、⟪k:2⟫どうでしたでしょうか？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1E215EC3_0314_4F72_BF79_25A39094A182
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 157653d6265934e5947fac7db1e5d4bcfc16b8a66ac03888ed6ba840b55a0a93
#. default-sha256: bc36478c89ec16cd61e8421b955a94b9844c0d4040b232e2de30c26299f5c9d5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1E215EC3_0314_4F72_BF79_25A39094A182"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I imagine you would have, with your interest in new technology.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Next time you "
"have a chance, I would enjoy hearing what they had on display.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫新しいものが好きなあなたのことです。⟪k:1⟫きっと、⟪k:2⟫行かれたんでしょうね。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫何が"
"あったのか、⟪k:5⟫今度でいいから……教えてくださいね。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F8F3D491_104A_4468_AEFE_334A97CAECF8
