msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a year ago.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Got quite a bit of attention,⟪k:3⟫since it was supposed to have "
"been held in Paris."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あれも一年前だった。⟪k:1⟫……本来パリで開かれるものだからな――ずいぶんと話題になったものだよ。"

