msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was busy... ⟪k:1⟫preparing for our wedding.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I had no time to attend an exhibition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私は……、⟪k:1⟫君との結婚の準備で――忙しかった。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫博覧会に行く余裕もなかったんだ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DD4E2548_7FAA_44ED_BE4B_A77BF4A6682B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e4b54ccbb9dea962bede1ec4ea83952dae1363307be04b0bcfa2b711b08b81d
