#: scenario3:scenario3_0BC53DE5_2D46_45BF_9360_BFCBD8EA10EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df8ee8d12b8d26a14e814e7d76b1b1524ee1d04adde49091288c0b90db7817be
#. default-sha256: 33ea3aa71f72848315bc2c298f1dc2dab9244bc5c98f7b6c2d58102d84bdfcd9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0BC53DE5_2D46_45BF_9360_BFCBD8EA10EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had he simply stepped up and taken action,⟪k:1⟫he could have put an end to the stream of "
"letters,⟪k:2⟫each of which gave rise to further misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫誤解ばかりが産まれるすれ違いの手紙も、⟪k:1⟫彼が行動を起こしさえすれば、⟪k:2⟫終わったはずなん"
"です。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_71E4F38E_1917_4891_8C16_CC927E4DD979
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f00c27886efd7aa5a318a19e9969926af7bae18e99ef7d03e4af45950c69eab
#. default-sha256: d2361edb4fae0a433cca4304b92bcf1f497e00c51d640edb626aaf0cd4256eb3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_71E4F38E_1917_4891_8C16_CC927E4DD979"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He needed merely ask the White-Haired Girl in-person to whom the letters were addressed, "
"whether what they described were true, and the twisted threads of his confusion would have all "
"been unraveled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫これは事実なのか？⟪k:1⟫　誰に宛てた手紙なんだ？⟪k:2⟫　そのように白い髪の娘と直接向き合えば、"
"⟪k:3⟫絡み合った誤りの糸も解けていくはずなのに。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B27EDCA0_0BD4_4396_80E5_F308942A3E78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 294f1affb726b1566b5140c27921b39381cd8b8ee54dd822fc27f5e83464e450
#. default-sha256: 7761c8e2e4e814207e4db0d2193443367137ce7c1d4a2f85ed5db29244b318ab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B27EDCA0_0BD4_4396_80E5_F308942A3E78"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But he made no such effort, relying instead on Maria to serve as his intermediary."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど彼は、⟪k:1⟫マリーアに仲介を頼むだけで、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫動こうとはしませんでした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_575730D3_EF40_4CB9_A37C_1A2484F91D0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6747833e10b0b1dda14ef835c55e78861495e4f2c63cd5dba0894327bce0f5ed
#. default-sha256: 906a1c14d6555f050726497cfcd7f91d8ea096158404eaef991b6648c58574cd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_575730D3_EF40_4CB9_A37C_1A2484F91D0B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I feel as though I have now, at long last,⟪k:1⟫come to understand just what kind of man "
"Jacopo was."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくし、⟪k:1⟫ようやく、⟪k:2⟫彼という人間が分かったような気がいたします。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_92DD5E58_656C_41CC_B352_6418C5733715
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1766c0c5db0e37da33b1a4263ffe2c10e9bb04940afb1b85f06e5a8935788354
#. default-sha256: a3966515130aecb75fb0b5d62f258939d1e851cf570c3b1f030134b4164ee3f8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_92DD5E58_656C_41CC_B352_6418C5733715"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While he had a great deal of pride in his capabilities,⟪k:1⟫he had far less confidence in "
"himself as a person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼は非常に自尊心の高い男ではありましたが――その逆に、⟪k:1⟫自分のことを評価出来ない人間でもあっ"
"たのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8B5731DA_FAA4_4F9A_9D09_516331D630E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b17e27a1461f7082535b5eed39e1e21e871ce780ee806763ed5c0aedb3e0752b
#. default-sha256: eb1520153079a71ea154d821a5012f70212957ec7dc05a9b1787e6d8a29b0601
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8B5731DA_FAA4_4F9A_9D09_516331D630E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If he’d had faith in himself, perhaps he could have put faith in his wife as well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫自分を信じていれば、⟪k:1⟫妻のことも信じられたでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_996E988B_CC27_45E8_9A67_223B48B8DA7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 333f442408116a2201e3351d85a4bba862fbdcb24f7538e04f064166f55c6108
#. default-sha256: 8fb1542c6fdbc46ea43d168175628599be233596a2603476b8328b6903f289e0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_996E988B_CC27_45E8_9A67_223B48B8DA7D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had his pride not been so twisted, perhaps he would not have been so afraid of being hurt."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫自尊心が歪んでいなければ、⟪k:1⟫傷つくことを恐れずに済んだでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5DF31479_AE4D_47D3_9E22_F2AB4CCB1D45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 899bef82409c14f8c392ae1dcea8f17a60c1f098aaa473a78fc66341d08919e3
#. default-sha256: 62e440a4bb62ea997cca85ca93ccc5c1d4d3ff114078012326838059b94f192d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5DF31479_AE4D_47D3_9E22_F2AB4CCB1D45"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Indeed, he was afraid. ⟪k:1⟫Afraid of being rejected by her. ⟪k:2⟫Afraid to face a reality "
"where his beloved partner scorned him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そう――彼は恐れていたのです。⟪k:1⟫彼女に面と向かって否定されてしまう瞬間を。⟪k:2⟫愛する人に見"
"向きもされないという現実を。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9D8604A1_08B8_4080_A485_47F651DB92D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02a9360a82c07cb70da5aefe3ea1c3d567ba800375ac22d7e23d8515370fd707
#. default-sha256: c6140f7fa0abb23f300ea193a0d4d1567d4b10d138e1f8550b9c1a9693ef1527
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9D8604A1_08B8_4080_A485_47F651DB92D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Where the woman he loved laughed at him disdainfully. ⟪k:1⟫Where she and countless others "
"mocked him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫愛する人に振り向かれず、⟪k:1⟫笑われただけでなく――その蔑みが不特定多数から向けられると想像する"
"だけで。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9990F753_29BB_42C7_B5B6_30DF42842E92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69270959f46858b4da35aca5eea0f5b43234da64391df84ed3e0e5feddcc536b
#. default-sha256: 54a07f026c16188f6ca0f0e3fbe4b6580e908b3d6be4c8fa40563c6b36be0096
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9990F753_29BB_42C7_B5B6_30DF42842E92"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The thought of it paralyzed him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫動けなく、⟪k:1⟫なってしまうのでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AF3D5FD7_689B_4584_97BD_E11E0CA4850E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f54101f61f636c5412043cf4144de5997576f0ffa321535b1f03354708edf8ad
#. default-sha256: 2344688df6f61aeed82a9fbedaa5a15ebc37746fd5d631f15b02cf404abfbfd2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AF3D5FD7_689B_4584_97BD_E11E0CA4850E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The environment in which he had been raised played a significant part in his state of mind, "
"I expect."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もちろんそれには、⟪k:1⟫彼の生い立ちも深く絡んでいたと思いますけれど。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_07A83A0C_6C2D_4683_8E9F_FA0A89328402
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10c153ed658265a6075b38bd9b15272a357dd57fa6d3e4d724c1424cc77624e8
#. default-sha256: 58da33ae1e4f918d481c2a3df40166619f5db431b7e2e8c70c78efba5c9c8c65
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_07A83A0C_6C2D_4683_8E9F_FA0A89328402"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Occasionally, the name on the letter would change.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maria was making the White-"
"Haired Girl out to be having affairs with multiple other men."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……手紙の宛名は、⟪k:1⟫時折、⟪k:2⟫変わりました。⟪k:3⟫マリーアは、⟪k:4⟫白い髪の娘を、⟪k:5⟫不特定"
"の男と関係を持っていた不貞の妻にしておりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A45E1A2B_7E31_4F08_A830_BA8B1F55B6A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d8f047fc276a0a6c00c8dd83547ebdb496958c515f9e8aa9501f53c1c91325f
#. default-sha256: 2531ea6760105f033d21daf18027e162c27ea1a371280a9ca0e2ee8d77edf8e2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A45E1A2B_7E31_4F08_A830_BA8B1F55B6A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She could never do any such thing, of course."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そんなことは、⟪k:1⟫あるはずもないのに――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CF09187E_FDCF_423D_8B2C_E7DC2200258D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 688793a10d6976ebc945410f1cbcf15058ffd49dbd4978784b4ce33b2d1d2b25
#. default-sha256: 5a6d329c337b547bd455da33830f79d024d95630cf6543c465f9990572c85160
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CF09187E_FDCF_423D_8B2C_E7DC2200258D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But Jacopo, thinking Maria to be his only ally, believed everything she said."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ヤコポは、⟪k:1⟫マリーアを唯一の味方と思い、⟪k:2⟫すべて信じてしまうのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_85F9856C_822E_4A4C_A693_C23F84D440E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 443ea9e95b726338ab2eed4ff046c5811f5d8f2546a60c0c1351183da8a5b636
#. default-sha256: 178259420bcb4a1295f4049027c8b822dc6e002cfeaac9308b4e9f7c2f551975
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_85F9856C_822E_4A4C_A693_C23F84D440E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(If I could figure out who this man is... ⟪k:1⟫and where he resides...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（この男の所在を……、⟪k:1⟫こいつが何者か突き止めれば――）"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C30E4E6D_D7C7_4EA8_BF2B_99E04DFA4B06
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
